BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td 14 TL (Security policy) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (This policy applies to everyone who works for Larkspur Labs, including) Tj T* (contractors.) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (Accounts and passwords) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (Every account uses a unique password of at least 14 characters, stored in the) Tj T* (company password manager. Passwords are never shared, not even with IT or your) Tj T* (manager. Multi-factor authentication is required for every company account;) Tj T* (use the authenticator app or a hardware security key, never text messages.) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (If you think a password has leaked, change it immediately and tell the) Tj T* (security team in the security channel.) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (Devices) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (Company laptops must have disk encryption switched on, the screen must lock) Tj T* (after five minutes without activity, and operating system updates must be) Tj T* (installed within seven days of their release. Laptops that miss updates for) Tj T* (longer are blocked from company systems until they are updated.) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (Personal phones may be used for email and chat if they have a screen lock and) Tj T* (are enrolled in the device management app. Customer data must never be stored) Tj T* (on a personal device.) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (Lost or stolen devices) Tj T* ( ) Tj T* (Report a lost or stolen laptop or phone to the security team within one hour,) Tj T* (at any time of day, through the security hotline. The device is wiped) Tj T* (remotely; reporting quickly matters more than finding it.) Tj T* ET
endstream
